# --- Data ---
# We COMMIT the misc snapshot (data/cardinfo_misc.json, ~24MB) on purpose: prices are a
# moving target, so committing the exact snapshot is what makes this analysis reproducible.
# If you'd rather keep the repo lean, uncomment the next line and rely on the pull command
# in the README (results will then differ from ours as prices drift).
# data/cardinfo_misc.json

# Stale first pull (superseded by cardinfo_misc.json — safe to delete locally):
data/cardinfo_raw.json

# Growing personal price database + collector log (the tool's data).
# NOTE: price history CANNOT be re-pulled — this file is precious once it accrues. Back it up
# (e.g. Time Machine / a periodic copy). It's gitignored to keep the repo from bloating daily.
data/ygo.db
data/collector.log

